; Stuffit's rooms, played in this order; source/pack.h reads them.
; A room is written at its own size, at most 11 across and 19 down, and
; centred in the game's: # wall, . floor, A to D where the worms' heads
; start, a to d the rest of each worm's cells.
; The brutal pack: 20 rooms, the deepest trap rising.

